# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=mtdev
pkgver=1.1.7
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="Turns touchpads' and touchscreens' multi-touch events into one form"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://bitmath.org/code/mtdev/"
license=(MIT)
depends=(glibc)
source=("https://bitmath.org/code/mtdev/mtdev-$pkgver.tar.bz2")
sha256sums=('PIN')

build() {
    cd mtdev-$pkgver
    ./configure --prefix=/usr --disable-static
    make
}

package() {
    cd mtdev-$pkgver
    make DESTDIR="$pkgdir" install
}
